  kit env push --github           # GitHub Actions secrets only
  kit env push --target edge --github
  kit env push --yes              # everything, no prompt (CI)
  kit env push --dry-run

Options
  -h, --help             Show help
  -V, --version          Show kit version
      --json             Write one JSON document to stdout; no prompts or animation
  -n, --dry-run          Plan and run read-only steps; skip mutations
