  -v, --verbose      Stream all child output
  -q, --quiet        Errors and summary only
      --bail         Stop at the first failure
      --to <string>  Version id to roll back to (default: the last deployment with different code)

"
`;

exports[`help kit release rollout --help 1`] = `
"Change the production rollout: Play staged rollout, App Store phased release

Usage
  kit release rollout [options]

Examples
  kit release rollout android --percent 25
  kit release rollout android --halt --yes
  kit release rollout ios --resume
  kit release rollout ios --complete --dry-run

Options
  -h, --help              Show help
  -V, --version           Show kit version
      --json              Write one JSON document to stdout; no prompts or animation
  -n, --dry-run           Plan and run read-only steps; skip mutations
  -y, --yes               Accept confirmations (never skips prod)
  -v, --verbose           Stream all child output
  -q, --quiet             Errors and summary only
      --bail              Stop at the first failure
      --percent <number>  Android: staged-rollout percentage, 1-100 (100 completes it); prod confirmation
      --halt              Halt the Play rollout, or pause the App Store phased release (--yes skips the confirm)
      --resume            Resume a halted rollout or a paused phased release; prod confirmation
      --complete          Release to everyone now; prod confirmation
      --build <number>    Android: version code of the release to change (when the track holds more than one)

"
`;

